<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c.bank cuts four repo rates by 0.25 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary c.bank cuts four repo rates by 0.25 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday it cut its four repo rates by 0.25 percentage points each, with immediate effect.</p>
<p>It said the overnight reverse repo rate remained flat.</p>
<p>&quot;The interest rate change is in accordance with market processes,&quot; the NBH said in a statement.</p>
</text>
